cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "saccadero-open: a robot program for the LIBERO-Pro2.0 benchmark"
message: "If you use this code or its results, cite it as below, and cite the benchmark (arXiv:2610.24587)."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Rowant Labs"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-24"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  A robot program for the LIBERO-Pro2.0 simulation benchmark, written without demonstrations, a policy network or
  a language model in the control loop, and the records of two registered runs on the benchmark's test split
  (Overall 81.1 by the public board's own weighting, 81.2 by the formula registered before the runs). Developed on
  the training split's perturbations; uses the benchmark's object models; simulation only; not a foundation model
  and not a board placement.
